      "title": "File:Early medieval fort at Jebel Umm Marrahi (Sudan).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/Early_medieval_fort_at_Jebel_Umm_Marrahi_%28Sudan%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
